# TASK-260715-2rcvr0 handoff

## Outcome

Added `docs/m1-runtime-ownership-and-operations.md`, the four-page source/rendered lifecycle diagram under `diagrams/`, README discoverability, corrected the stale Core boundary statement, and recorded the live-entry anomaly in `LOGBOOK.md`. The guide traces implemented ownership, start/rollback/app-termination/stop, dependencies, v1 messages, state/capability facts, three error surfaces, diagnostics privacy, troubleshooting, commands, migration isolation, and concrete M2-M5 seams.

## Review notes

The shared M1 runtime and M0-bound macOS factory are implemented and tested. The checked-in generated macOS `PacketTunnelProvider` is still a no-op/version-query shell and does not instantiate `MacOSProviderCompositionRoot`; iOS production targets remain deferred. Build success is not claimed as live runtime-wiring evidence. M1 reports TCP plus safe DNS as `connectedDegraded` with UDP false, never full UDP. No implementation behavior, future promise, board element, or dependency was added; the existing atomic task and three completed prerequisites are the smallest sufficient decomposition. Direct code/test inspection resolved the documentation questions, so no research task or justified-gap element was created.

## Negative evidence reviewed

`MacOSProductionDependencyFactory.makeRuntime` negatives distinguish absent/unreadable input and reject digest/semantic narrowing before construction. `M1PrivateIngressDispatcher` admits only virtual-DNS UDP and rejects general UDP. `TunnelProviderAdapter.handleAppMessage` negatives reject malformed, missing/duplicate/stale IDs and non-running requests. Runtime/SSH diagnostic tests prove hostile values and identifiers are absent from production snapshots. Harness negatives traverse `HarnessApplication.run` with independent admitted/refused bounds and exact nonzero scenario exits.

## Validation

All commands exited 0: eight focused Swift suites (105 tests), `make m1-runtime-harness-test` (6 tests plus 7 fixture rows), both SwiftPM adapter builds, `make macos-targets-validate` (unsigned macOS host/provider Debug and Release), PlantUML check/render plus visual inspection of four pages, 52 local-link checks, source-contract checks, and `git diff --check`. Logs are under `.temp/TASK-260715-2rcvr0/`.

